<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Oct CPI inflation slips to 20.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Oct CPI inflation slips to 20.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index slipped 0.3 percent in October from September, bringing the year-on-year rate to 20.2 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    Oct 1996    Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +20.2	 +20.6	 +22.4</p>
<p>All-items index		 425.9	 427.1	 354.4</p>
<p>Food-only index		 560.1	 568.1	 454.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
